  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "The culture media used were LB broth (BD Diagnostic Systems, Sparks, MD) and a defined medium containing the following composition per liter: 16 g glycerol, 1.0 g (NH4)2SO4, and mineral components consisted of 1.0 g MgSO4•7H2O, 0.015 g CaCl2•2H2O, 1.0 ml of a trace element solution, 1.0 ml stock A solution, and 35.2 ml 1.0 M phosphate buffer as described [66]."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": "The trace element solution contained (per L of water): FeSO4.7H2O, 0.5 g; ZnSO4.7H2O, 0.4 g; MnSO4.H2O, 0.02 g, H3BO3, 0.015 g; NiCl2.6H2O, 0.01 g, EDTA, 0.25 g; CoCl2.6H2O, 0.05 g; and CuCl2.2H2O, 0.005 g."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Stock A solution contained: (per L of water) NaMoO4.2H2O, 2.0 g; and FeNa.EDTA, 5.0 g."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": "Phosphate buffer (1 M) contains (per L of water): K2HPO4, 113 g; KH2PO4, 47 g."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "comment": ""
    }
  ]
}